#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/bcp38/form.js:40
msgid "Allowed IP ranges"
msgstr "Tillåtna IP-intervall"

#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/bcp38/form.js:24
msgid "Auto-detect upstream IP"
msgstr "Identifiera uppströms-IP automatiskt"

#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/bcp38/form.js:25
msgid ""
"Automatically attempt to detect whether the upstream IP will be blocked by "
"the configuration, adding an exception if so. If this does not work "
"correctly, you can add exceptions manually below."
msgstr ""
"Försök automatiskt identifiera om den uppströms IP-adressen blockeras av "
"konfigurationen och lägg i så fall till ett undantag. Om detta inte fungerar "
"korrekt kan du lägga till undantag manuellt nedan."

#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/bcp38/form.js:10
#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/root/usr/share/luci/menu.d/luci-app-bcp38.json:3
msgid "BCP38"
msgstr "BCP38"

#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/bcp38/form.js:17
msgid "BCP38 config"
msgstr "BCP38-konfiguration"

#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/bcp38/form.js:37
msgid "Blocked IP ranges"
msgstr "Blockerade IP-intervall"

#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/bcp38/form.js:20
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "Aktivera"

#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/bcp38/form.js:13
msgid ""
"For IPv6, only source specific default routes are installed, so no BCP38 "
"firewall routes are needed."
msgstr ""
"För IPv6 installeras endast källspecifika standardrutter, så inga BCP38-"
"brandväggsrutter behövs."

#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-bcp38.json:3
msgid "Grant UCI access for luci-app-bcp38"
msgstr "Ge luci-app-bcp38 UCI-åtkomst"

#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/bcp38/form.js:30
msgid "Interface name"
msgstr "Gränssnittsnamn"

#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/bcp38/form.js:31
msgid ""
"Interface to apply the blocking to (should be the upstream WAN interface)."
msgstr ""
"Gränssnitt som blockeringen ska tillämpas på (bör vara det uppströms WAN-"
"gränssnittet)."

#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/bcp38/form.js:41
msgid ""
"Takes precedence over blocked ranges. Use to whitelist your upstream network "
"if you're behind a double NAT and the auto-detection doesn't work."
msgstr ""
"Har företräde framför blockerade intervall. Använd detta för att lägga till "
"ditt uppströmsnätverk i tillåtelselistan om du befinner dig bakom dubbel NAT "
"och den automatiska identifieringen inte fungerar."

#: applications/luci-app-bcp38/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/bcp38/form.js:11
msgid ""
"This function blocks packets with private address destinations from going "
"out onto the internet as per %s"
msgstr ""
"Den här funktionen blockerar paket med privata destinationsadresser från att "
"skickas ut på internet enligt %s"
